            <sparkle:shortVersionString>1.0.4</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <description><![CDATA[<ul>
  <li>See people as a table, a board or a gallery of faces.</li>
  <li>Add your own fields, like Kids or Gift ideas, and several emails and phone numbers.</li>
  <li>Callouts and embedded pages, and open an Obsidian vault as a notebook.</li>
  <li>Light, Dark or System appearance.</li>
  <li>Fixes for iCloud setup, meetings and privacy.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
