        <item>
            <title>1.0.3</title>
            <pubDate>Sat, 21 Nov 2026 09:37:56 +1000</pubDate>
            <sparkle:version>202611202332</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>1.0.3</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <description><![CDATA[<ul>
  <li>Steadier and faster: dozens of fixes from a full stability review, for crashes, freezes and slowdowns.</li>
  <li>When the same page is edited on two devices at once, every line from both is kept.</li>
  <li>Saving a page iCloud is still downloading no longer pauses the app; your edit goes in when the page arrives.</li>
  <li>Typing, the Log sentence and long pages are quicker, and search indexing and widgets update in the background.</li>
  <li>Opening a page with a photo in the middle no longer rewrites it.</li>
  <li>Reading View and the editor treat code as code, not as people or links.</li>
  <li>While private people are locked, they stay out of the Timeline filter, duplicates and the Sync counts.</li>
  <li>Dates read correctly on devices set to the Japanese or another non-Gregorian calendar.</li>
  <li>Export builds its preview once, so choosing a style is quick.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
